iews and comparisons of AI coding tools. Cursor, Windsurf, GitHub Copilot, Cline, Aider, and more — tested by working developers, with verified data and honest verdicts.","inLanguage":"en-US","publisher":{"@id":"https://aicoderscope.com/#org"}},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://aicoderscope.com/#org","name":"AICoderScope","url":"https://aicoderscope.com/","description":"Independent reviews and comparisons of AI coding tools, including local-LLM coding setups, with pricing verified against official sources.","knowsAbout":["AI coding tools","AI code assistants","local LLM coding","developer tools"],"logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://aicoderscope.com/favicon.svg"}}]}</script><!-- Google Analytics 4 --><script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-PJLKERLSNF"></script><script>
